# Client-only builds (`npm run build:spa`). Understood by Cloudflare Pages and
# Netlify.
#
# The full `npm run build` REPLACES this file: scripts/prerender.mjs writes
# dist/_redirects with one 301 per old area URL and rewrites for the app-only
# routes, because Cloudflare Pages applies redirects before static files and a
# catch-all would shadow the prerendered pages.
#
# Here nothing is prerendered, so everything goes to the app, which routes it
# (including sending old /breakdown-recovery-<area> URLs to the new address)
# or shows a 404. The 200 makes it a rewrite: the URL stays put.
/*    /index.html   200
